# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   For an app, this can be useful so that everyone uses the same Python version.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different OS, they may get conflicts.
#   In that case, the lock file should be gitignored.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock contains locking info, but can cause conflicts.
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock contains locking info, but can cause conflicts.
# pdm.lock

